OL,3,GNEWSABanned driver who drove off after 
OL,4,Afatal crash jailed                     
OL,6,FA banned, uninsured driver who did not 
OL,7,Fstop when the man he was driving in    
OL,8,Fconvoy with crashed his car into trees 
OL,9,Fand died has been jailed.              
OL,11,FMark Banks, 29, was driving a blue VW  
OL,12,FGolf on the A33 in Reading at about    
OL,13,F16:00 BST on 20 April 2024, with       
OL,14,F26-year-old James Browes, who was      
OL,15,Fdriving a black Vauxhall Astra.        
OL,17,FBrowes lost control of his car and was 
OL,18,Fkilled, while a passenger suffered     
OL,19,Fserious injuries. Banks, from          
OL,20,FBasingstoke, was said by police to have
OL,21,Fstopped briefly but then drove away.   
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
